04:49.050 --> 04:51.310
Nanti Anda langsung bawa dia pergi saja.

04:51.750 --> 04:52.810
Baik, begitu saja.

04:53.490 --> 04:53.970
Lan.

04:54.320 --> 04:55.650
Jaga dirimu baik-baik.

04:56.760 --> 04:57.560
Sampai jumpa.

04:57.810 --> 04:58.690
Kami pergi dulu.

04:58.690 --> 04:59.820
- Paman Dong, hati-hati.
- Kakak.

04:59.820 --> 05:00.320
- Baik.
- Sampai jumpa.

05:00.320 --> 05:00.890
Sampai jumpa, Bibi.

05:00.890 --> 05:01.690
Sampai jumpa.

05:15.640 --> 05:16.750
Kamu pulang saja.

05:17.010 --> 05:18.610
Aku bisa sendirian di rumah.

05:20.960 --> 05:21.400
Oh.

