27:41.440 --> 27:42.040
Benarkah?

27:42.240 --> 27:42.940
Iya.

27:43.640 --> 27:44.050
Lihat.

27:44.440 --> 27:45.200
Cepat buka pintunya.

27:45.200 --> 27:46.000
Cepat sekali.

27:47.770 --> 27:48.200
Le.

27:48.400 --> 27:48.770
Ayo.

27:50.160 --> 27:51.720
Bertindaklah sesuai panduan Ayah.

27:51.720 --> 27:52.520
Jangan takut.

27:55.850 --> 27:57.150
Aku datang.

27:57.440 --> 27:57.920
Pelan-pelan.

27:57.920 --> 27:58.650
Kak Yi, sini.

27:58.720 --> 27:59.720
